# pop'n music 6: the operator codes (RemyWiki, AC_pnm_6), typed in test mode as buttons 1-9
# (left to right), then the four new switches set to YES and saved (games/popn6/unlocks.toml).
#   hiraku-popn6 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn6-operator.his
# 38281838 on the main menu adds OPERATOR COMMAND OPTIONS; in it, the game compares the last
# 12 presses of buttons 1-4 and 6-9 with its five codes (FUN_80071810, table at 0x800721f8)
# and adds the matching item. Hold red + press blue switches an item; EXIT asks to save (NO
# by default).
game popn6
at 3000 press "Test" 6
at 3300 press "P1 Button 3" 4
